    "Automatic: Detects launcher from executable path\nManual: Use explicitly selected launcher type": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u062a\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a: \u064a\u0643\u062a\u0634\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u063a\u0651\u0644 \u0645\u0646 \u0645\u0633\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0646\u0641\u064a\u0630\u064a\n\u064a\u062f\u0648\u064a: \u064a\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0645 \u0646\u0648\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u063a\u0651\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u062f\u062f \u0635\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0629\u064b"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automaticky: rozpozn\u00e1 launcher podle cesty k souboru\nRu\u010dn\u011b: pou\u017eije vybran\u00fd typ launcheru"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisk: Genkender launcheren ud fra programmets sti\nManuelt: Bruger den valgte launchertype"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch: Erkennt den Launcher anhand des Programmpfads\nManuell: Verwendet den explizit gew\u00e4hlten Launcher-Typ"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic: Detects launcher from executable path\nManual: Use explicitly selected launcher type"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic: Detects launcher from executable path\nManual: Use explicitly selected launcher type"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autom\u00e1tico: detecta el lanzador a partir de la ruta del ejecutable\nManual: usa el tipo de lanzador seleccionado"
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automaattinen: Tunnistaa k\u00e4ynnistimen ohjelman polusta\nManuaalinen: K\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 valittua k\u00e4ynnistintyyppi\u00e4"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatique : d\u00e9tecte le lanceur \u00e0 partir du chemin de l'ex\u00e9cutable\nManuel : utilise le type de lanceur s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatico: rileva il launcher dal percorso dell'eseguibile\nManuale: usa il tipo di launcher selezionato"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u52d5: \u5b9f\u884c\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u306e\u30d1\u30b9\u304b\u3089\u30e9\u30f3\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3092\u5224\u5225\u3057\u307e\u3059\n\u624b\u52d5: \u660e\u793a\u7684\u306b\u9078\u629e\u3057\u305f\u30e9\u30f3\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u306e\u7a2e\u985e\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u307e\u3059"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc790\ub3d9: \uc2e4\ud589 \ud30c\uc77c \uacbd\ub85c\uc5d0\uc11c \ub7f0\ucc98\ub97c \uac10\uc9c0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4\n\uc218\ub3d9: \uc9c1\uc811 \uc120\ud0dd\ud55c \ub7f0\ucc98 \uc720\ud615\uc744 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatisch: herkent de launcher aan het pad van het programma\nHandmatig: gebruikt het expliciet gekozen launchertype"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatycznie: wykrywa launcher na podstawie \u015bcie\u017cki pliku\nR\u0119cznie: u\u017cywa wybranego typu launchera"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autom\u00e1tico: detecta o launcher pelo caminho do execut\u00e1vel\nManual: usa o tipo de launcher selecionado"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autom\u00e1tico: deteta o launcher a partir do caminho do execut\u00e1vel\nManual: usa o tipo de launcher selecionado"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automat: detecteaz\u0103 launcherul din calea executabilului\nManual: folose\u0219te tipul de launcher selectat"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438: \u043e\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440 \u043f\u043e \u043f\u0443\u0442\u0438 \u043a \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u044f\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u0443\n\u0412\u0440\u0443\u0447\u043d\u0443\u044e: \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0432\u044b\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0432\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0442\u0438\u043f \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0430"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatiskt: Identifierar launchern utifr\u00e5n programmets s\u00f6kv\u00e4g\nManuellt: Anv\u00e4nder den valda launchertypen"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otomatik: Ba\u015flat\u0131c\u0131y\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131labilir dosya yolundan alg\u0131lar\nManuel: A\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a se\u00e7ilen ba\u015flat\u0131c\u0131 t\u00fcr\u00fcn\u00fc kullan\u0131r"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u043d\u043e: \u0432\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0454 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440 \u0437\u0430 \u0448\u043b\u044f\u0445\u043e\u043c \u0434\u043e \u0444\u0430\u0439\u043b\u0443\n\u0412\u0440\u0443\u0447\u043d\u0443: \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0443\u0454\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0432\u0438\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0432\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0442\u0438\u043f \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0430"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng: Nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n tr\u00ecnh kh\u1edfi ch\u1ea1y t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn t\u1ec7p th\u1ef1c thi\nTh\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng: D\u00f9ng lo\u1ea1i tr\u00ecnh kh\u1edfi ch\u1ea1y \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ecdn"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u52a8\uff1a\u6839\u636e\u53ef\u6267\u884c\u6587\u4ef6\u8def\u5f84\u8bc6\u522b\u542f\u52a8\u5668\n\u624b\u52a8\uff1a\u4f7f\u7528\u660e\u786e\u9009\u62e9\u7684\u542f\u52a8\u5668\u7c7b\u578b"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u52d5\uff1a\u4f9d\u53ef\u57f7\u884c\u6a94\u8def\u5f91\u8fa8\u8b58\u555f\u52d5\u5668\n\u624b\u52d5\uff1a\u4f7f\u7528\u660e\u78ba\u9078\u64c7\u7684\u555f\u52d5\u5668\u985e\u578b"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically enables DXVK when launcher requires it (e.g., Rockstar Games Launcher)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u064a\u0641\u0639\u0651\u0644 DXVK \u062a\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a\u064b\u0627 \u0639\u0646\u062f\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u062a\u0637\u0644\u0628\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u063a\u0651\u0644 (\u0645\u062b\u0644 Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automaticky zapne DXVK, pokud to launcher vy\u017eaduje (nap\u0159. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiverer automatisk DXVK, n\u00e5r launcheren kr\u00e6ver det (f.eks. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiviert DXVK automatisch, wenn der Launcher es erfordert (z. B. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatically enables DXVK when launcher requires it (e.g., Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatically enables DXVK when launcher requires it (e.g., Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activa DXVK autom\u00e1ticamente cuando el lanzador lo requiere (por ejemplo, Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ottaa DXVK:n automaattisesti k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00f6n, kun k\u00e4ynnistin vaatii sit\u00e4 (esim. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active automatiquement DXVK lorsque le lanceur l'exige (par exemple Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attiva automaticamente DXVK quando il launcher lo richiede (ad esempio Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30e9\u30f3\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3068\u3059\u308b\u5834\u5408 (Rockstar Games Launcher \u306a\u3069) \u306b DXVK \u3092\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u6709\u52b9\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3059"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub7f0\ucc98\uc5d0 \ud544\uc694\ud55c \uacbd\uc6b0(\uc608: Rockstar Games Launcher) DXVK\ub97c \uc790\ub3d9\uc73c\ub85c \ud65c\uc131\ud654\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schakelt DXVK automatisch in wanneer de launcher dat vereist (bijv. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatycznie w\u0142\u0105cza DXVK, gdy wymaga tego launcher (np. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ativa o DXVK automaticamente quando o launcher exige (por exemplo, Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ativa o DXVK automaticamente quando o launcher o exige (por exemplo, Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activeaz\u0103 automat DXVK c\u00e2nd launcherul o cere (de exemplu Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442 DXVK, \u0435\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440 (\u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0435\u0440, Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiverar DXVK automatiskt n\u00e4r launchern kr\u00e4ver det (t.ex. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ba\u015flat\u0131c\u0131 gerektirdi\u011finde DXVK'y\u0131 otomatik olarak etkinle\u015ftirir (\u00f6rn. Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u043d\u043e \u0432\u043c\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0454 DXVK, \u044f\u043a\u0449\u043e \u0446\u044c\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0432\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0454 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440 (\u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0434, Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u1eadt DXVK khi tr\u00ecnh kh\u1edfi ch\u1ea1y y\u00eau c\u1ea7u (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: Rockstar Games Launcher)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u542f\u52a8\u5668\u9700\u8981\u65f6\uff08\u4f8b\u5982 Rockstar Games Launcher\uff09\u81ea\u52a8\u542f\u7528 DXVK"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7576\u555f\u52d5\u5668\u9700\u8981\u6642\uff08\u4f8b\u5982 Rockstar Games Launcher\uff09\u81ea\u52d5\u555f\u7528 DXVK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
