          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f Steam, Rockstar, EA App, Epic Games \u0438 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0445 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0445 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0432 (frankea/Whisky#41)"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiverar automatiska \u00e5tg\u00e4rder f\u00f6r Steam, Rockstar, EA App, Epic Games och andra spellaunchers (frankea/Whisky#41)"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam, Rockstar, EA App, Epic Games ve di\u011fer oyun ba\u015flat\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 i\u00e7in otomatik d\u00fczeltmeleri etkinle\u015ftirir (frankea/Whisky#41)"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u043c\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0454 \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u043d\u0456 \u0432\u0438\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f Steam, Rockstar, EA App, Epic Games \u0442\u0430 \u0456\u043d\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u0456\u0433\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0445 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0456\u0432 (frankea/Whisky#41)"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B\u1eadt c\u00e1c b\u1ea3n s\u1eeda l\u1ed7i t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng cho Steam, Rockstar, EA App, Epic Games v\u00e0 c\u00e1c tr\u00ecnh kh\u1edfi ch\u1ea1y game kh\u00e1c (frankea/Whisky#41)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e3a Steam\u3001Rockstar\u3001EA App\u3001Epic Games \u7b49\u6e38\u620f\u542f\u52a8\u5668\u542f\u7528\u81ea\u52a8\u4fee\u590d (frankea/Whisky#41)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u70ba Steam\u3001Rockstar\u3001EA App\u3001Epic Games \u7b49\u904a\u6232\u555f\u52d5\u5668\u555f\u7528\u81ea\u52d5\u4fee\u6b63 (frankea/Whisky#41)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enables workarounds for common game controller detection and mapping issues on macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u064a\u0641\u0639\u0651\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0644\u0648\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u062f\u064a\u0644\u0629 \u0644\u0645\u0634\u0643\u0644\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0643\u062a\u0634\u0627\u0641 \u0648\u062d\u062f\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0643\u0645 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0628 \u0648\u062a\u0639\u064a\u064a\u0646 \u0623\u0632\u0631\u0627\u0631\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0627\u0626\u0639\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zap\u00edn\u00e1 n\u00e1hradn\u00ed \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed b\u011b\u017en\u00fdch pot\u00ed\u017e\u00ed s rozpozn\u00e1n\u00edm a mapov\u00e1n\u00edm hern\u00edch ovlada\u010d\u016f v macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiverer l\u00f8sninger p\u00e5 almindelige problemer med registrering og tildeling af controllere p\u00e5 macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiviert Problemumgehungen f\u00fcr h\u00e4ufige Probleme bei Controller-Erkennung und -Zuordnung unter macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activa soluciones para los problemas habituales de detecci\u00f3n y asignaci\u00f3n de mandos en macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ottaa k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00f6n kiertotavat yleisiin peliohjainten tunnistus- ja m\u00e4\u00e4ritysongelmiin macOS:ss\u00e4 (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active des contournements pour les probl\u00e8mes courants de d\u00e9tection et de mappage des manettes sur macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attiva soluzioni per i problemi comuni di rilevamento e mappatura dei controller su macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS \u3067\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u306e\u691c\u51fa\u3084\u30de\u30c3\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0\u306e\u554f\u984c\u306b\u5bfe\u3059\u308b\u56de\u907f\u7b56\u3092\u6709\u52b9\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3059 (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS\uc5d0\uc11c \ud754\ud788 \ubc1c\uc0dd\ud558\ub294 \uac8c\uc784 \ucee8\ud2b8\ub864\ub7ec \uac10\uc9c0 \ubc0f \ub9e4\ud551 \ubb38\uc81c\uc758 \uc6b0\ud68c \uc870\uce58\ub97c \ud65c\uc131\ud654\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4 (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schakelt oplossingen in voor veelvoorkomende problemen met controllerdetectie en -toewijzing op macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W\u0142\u0105cza obej\u015bcia typowych problem\u00f3w z wykrywaniem i mapowaniem kontroler\u00f3w w macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ativa solu\u00e7\u00f5es para problemas comuns de detec\u00e7\u00e3o e mapeamento de controles no macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ativa solu\u00e7\u00f5es para os problemas habituais de dete\u00e7\u00e3o e mapeamento de comandos no macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activeaz\u0103 solu\u021bii pentru problemele frecvente de detectare \u0219i mapare a controllerelor pe macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043e\u0431\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044b\u0445 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c \u0441 \u043e\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c \u043a\u043d\u043e\u043f\u043e\u043a \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0432 \u0432 macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktiverar l\u00f6sningar p\u00e5 vanliga problem med identifiering och knappmappning av handkontroller p\u00e5 macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS'te s\u0131k g\u00f6r\u00fclen oyun kumandas\u0131 alg\u0131lama ve tu\u015f e\u015fleme sorunlar\u0131 i\u00e7in ge\u00e7ici \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcmleri etkinle\u015ftirir (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u043c\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0454 \u043e\u0431\u0445\u0456\u0434\u043d\u0456 \u0440\u0456\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0442\u0438\u043f\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0445 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c \u0456\u0437 \u0440\u043e\u0437\u043f\u0456\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f\u043c \u0456 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f\u043c \u043a\u043d\u043e\u043f\u043e\u043a \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0440\u0456\u0432 \u0443 macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B\u1eadt c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p thay th\u1ebf cho nh\u1eefng s\u1ef1 c\u1ed1 th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p v\u1ec1 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 \u00e1nh x\u1ea1 n\u00fat tay c\u1ea7m tr\u00ean macOS (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u542f\u7528\u9488\u5bf9 macOS \u4e0a\u5e38\u89c1\u6e38\u620f\u63a7\u5236\u5668\u8bc6\u522b\u548c\u6620\u5c04\u95ee\u9898\u7684\u53d8\u901a\u65b9\u6848 (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u555f\u7528\u91dd\u5c0d macOS \u4e0a\u5e38\u898b\u904a\u6232\u63a7\u5236\u5668\u5075\u6e2c\u8207\u5c0d\u61c9\u554f\u984c\u7684\u56e0\u61c9\u63aa\u65bd (frankea/Whisky#42)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
