    },
    "Reports high-end GPU to pass launcher compatibility checks. Fixes EA App black screen and \"GPU not supported\" errors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u064a\u0628\u0644\u0651\u063a \u0639\u0646 GPU \u0639\u0627\u0644\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062f\u0627\u0621 \u0644\u062a\u062c\u0627\u0648\u0632 \u0641\u062d\u0648\u0635\u0627\u062a \u062a\u0648\u0627\u0641\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u063a\u0651\u0644\u0627\u062a. \u064a\u0635\u0644\u062d \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0627\u0634\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0648\u062f\u0627\u0621 \u0641\u064a EA App \u0648\u0623\u062e\u0637\u0627\u0621 \u00abGPU \u063a\u064a\u0631 \u0645\u062f\u0639\u0648\u0645\u00bb."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hl\u00e1s\u00ed v\u00fdkonn\u00e9 GPU, aby pro\u0161ly kontroly launcher\u016f. Opravuje \u010dernou obrazovku EA App a chyby \u201eGPU not supported\u201c."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oplyser en kraftig GPU, s\u00e5 launcheres tjek best\u00e5r. Retter sort sk\u00e6rm i EA App og fejl om GPU, der ikke underst\u00f8ttes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meldet eine High-End-GPU f\u00fcr Launcher-Pr\u00fcfungen. Behebt schwarze Bildschirme der EA App und \u201eGPU nicht unterst\u00fctzt\u201c."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reports high-end GPU to pass launcher compatibility checks. Fixes EA App black screen and \"GPU not supported\" errors."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reports high-end GPU to pass launcher compatibility checks. Fixes EA App black screen and \"GPU not supported\" errors."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simula una GPU de gama alta para superar las comprobaciones de los lanzadores. Corrige la pantalla negra de EA App."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ilmoittaa tehokkaan GPU:n yhteensopivuustarkistuksia varten. Korjaa EA Appin mustan ruudun ja GPU-virheilmoitukset."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simule un GPU haut de gamme pour les contr\u00f4les des lanceurs. Corrige l'\u00e9cran noir et les erreurs GPU d'EA App."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dichiara una GPU di fascia alta per superare i controlli dei launcher. Corregge la schermata nera di EA App."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9ad8\u6027\u80fd\u306a GPU \u3068\u3057\u3066\u5831\u544a\u3057\u3001\u30e9\u30f3\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u306e\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u901a\u904e\u3055\u305b\u307e\u3059\u3002EA App \u306e\u9ed2\u753b\u9762\u3084\u300cGPU not supported\u300d\u30a8\u30e9\u30fc\u3092\u4fee\u6b63\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uace0\uc131\ub2a5 GPU\ub85c \ubcf4\uace0\ud574 \ub7f0\ucc98\uc758 \ud638\ud658\uc131 \uac80\uc0ac\ub97c \ud1b5\uacfc\uc2dc\ud0b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. EA App\uc758 \uac80\uc740 \ud654\uba74\uacfc \u201cGPU not supported\u201d \uc624\ub958\ub97c \uc218\uc815\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meldt een high-end GPU om launchercontroles te doorstaan. Verhelpt zwarte schermen in EA App en 'GPU niet ondersteund'."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zg\u0142asza wydajny GPU, aby przej\u015b\u0107 testy zgodno\u015bci launcher\u00f3w. Naprawia czarny ekran EA App i b\u0142\u0119dy \u201eGPU not supported\u201d."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Informa uma GPU de ponta para passar nas verifica\u00e7\u00f5es dos launchers. Corrige a tela preta do EA App."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comunica uma GPU topo de gama para passar as verifica\u00e7\u00f5es dos launchers. Corrige o ecr\u00e3 preto do EA App."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raporteaz\u0103 o plac\u0103 video de top pentru a trece verific\u0103rile launcherelor. Remediaz\u0103 ecranul negru din EA App."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043e \u043c\u043e\u0449\u043d\u043e\u043c GPU, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043a\u0438 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0432. \u0423\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u0447\u0451\u0440\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u044d\u043a\u0440\u0430\u043d EA App \u0438 \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043a\u0438 \u00abGPU not supported\u00bb."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anger ett kraftfullt grafikkort s\u00e5 att launchers kontroller godk\u00e4nns. \u00c5tg\u00e4rdar svart sk\u00e4rm i EA App och GPU-fel."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uyumluluk denetimini ge\u00e7mek i\u00e7in \u00fcst d\u00fczey GPU bildirir. EA App siyah ekran\u0131 ve \u201cGPU desteklenmiyor\u201d hatas\u0131n\u0131 giderir."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u0432\u0456\u0434\u043e\u043c\u043b\u044f\u0454 \u043f\u0440\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0443\u0436\u043d\u0438\u0439 GPU, \u0449\u043e\u0431 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0456\u0440\u043a\u0438 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0456\u0432. \u0423\u0441\u0443\u0432\u0430\u0454 \u0447\u043e\u0440\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u043d EA App \u0456 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u0438\u043b\u043a\u0438 \u00abGPU not supported\u00bb."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B\u00e1o c\u00e1o GPU cao c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t ki\u1ec3m tra c\u1ee7a tr\u00ecnh kh\u1edfi ch\u1ea1y. Kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh \u0111en EA App v\u00e0 l\u1ed7i \u201cGPU not supported\u201d."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u62a5\u544a\u4e3a\u9ad8\u7aef GPU \u4ee5\u901a\u8fc7\u542f\u52a8\u5668\u7684\u517c\u5bb9\u6027\u68c0\u67e5\u3002\u4fee\u590d EA App \u9ed1\u5c4f\u548c\u201cGPU not supported\u201d\u9519\u8bef\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u56de\u5831\u70ba\u9ad8\u968e GPU \u4ee5\u901a\u904e\u555f\u52d5\u5668\u7684\u76f8\u5bb9\u6027\u6aa2\u67e5\u3002\u4fee\u6b63 EA App \u9ed1\u756b\u9762\u8207\u300cGPU not supported\u300d\u932f\u8aa4\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
