        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0647\u0644 \u062a\u0631\u064a\u062f \u0625\u0632\u0627\u0644\u0629 \u0628\u064a\u0626\u0629 \u062a\u0634\u063a\u064a\u0644 Wine \u0641\u0642\u0637\u060c \u0623\u0645 \u0625\u0632\u0627\u0644\u0629 \u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0627 \u062e\u0632\u0651\u0646\u0647 Whisky \u2014 \u0628\u0645\u0627 \u0641\u064a \u0630\u0644\u0643 \u062c\u0645\u064a\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0632\u062c\u0627\u062c\u0627\u062a\u061f\n\n\u0625\u0632\u0627\u0644\u0629 \u0643\u0644 \u0634\u064a\u0621 \u0646\u0647\u0627\u0626\u064a\u0629 \u0648\u0644\u0627 \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062c\u0639 \u0639\u0646\u0647\u0627."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odstranit jen prost\u0159ed\u00ed Wine, nebo v\u0161e, co si Whisky ulo\u017eila \u2014 v\u010detn\u011b v\u0161ech lahv\u00ed?\n\nOdstran\u011bn\u00ed v\u0161eho je trval\u00e9 a nelze je vr\u00e1tit zp\u011bt."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vil du kun fjerne Wine-runtimen eller alt, hvad Whisky har arkiveret \u2014 inklusive alle flasker?\n\nAt fjerne alt er permanent og kan ikke fortrydes."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur die Wine-Runtime entfernen oder alles, was Whisky gesichert hat \u2013 einschlie\u00dflich aller Flaschen?\n\nAlles zu entfernen ist endg\u00fcltig und kann nicht r\u00fcckg\u00e4ngig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove the Wine runtime only, or remove everything Whisky has stored \u2014 including all bottles?\n\nRemoving everything is permanent and cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove the Wine runtime only, or remove everything Whisky has stored \u2014 including all bottles?\n\nRemoving everything is permanent and cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00bfQuieres eliminar solo el runtime de Wine o todo lo que Whisky ha guardado, incluidas todas las botellas?\n\nEliminarlo todo es permanente y no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poistetaanko vain Wine-ajoymp\u00e4rist\u00f6 vai kaikki Whiskyn tallentama \u2014 mukaan lukien kaikki pullot?\n\nKaiken poistaminen on lopullista eik\u00e4 sit\u00e4 voi perua."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprimer uniquement le runtime Wine, ou tout ce que Whisky a stock\u00e9, y compris toutes les bouteilles ?\n\nLa suppression compl\u00e8te est d\u00e9finitive et irr\u00e9versible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vuoi rimuovere solo il runtime Wine oppure tutto ci\u00f2 che Whisky ha salvato, incluse tutte le bottiglie?\n\nLa rimozione completa \u00e8 definitiva e non pu\u00f2 essere annullata."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine \u30e9\u30f3\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u3060\u3051\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f \u305d\u308c\u3068\u3082\u3001\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e Bottle \u3092\u542b\u3081\u3001Whisky \u304c\u4fdd\u5b58\u3057\u305f\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3092\u3059\u3079\u3066\u524a\u9664\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f\n\n\u3059\u3079\u3066\u524a\u9664\u3059\u308b\u3068\u5143\u306b\u623b\u305b\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wine \ub7f0\ud0c0\uc784\ub9cc \uc81c\uac70\ud558\uc2dc\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\uae4c, \uc544\ub2c8\uba74 \ubaa8\ub4e0 Bottle\uc744 \ud3ec\ud568\ud574 Whisky\uac00 \uc800\uc7a5\ud55c \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ud56d\ubaa9\uc744 \uc81c\uac70\ud558\uc2dc\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\uae4c?\n\n\ubaa8\ub450 \uc81c\uac70\ud558\uba74 \uc601\uad6c\uc801\uc774\uba70 \ub418\ub3cc\ub9b4 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alleen de Wine-runtime verwijderen, of alles wat Whisky heeft bewaard \u2014 inclusief alle flessen?\n\nAlles verwijderen is definitief en kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usun\u0105\u0107 tylko silnik Wine czy wszystko, co przechowuje Whisky \u2014 w tym wszystkie butelki?\n\nUsuni\u0119cie wszystkiego jest trwa\u0142e i nieodwracalne."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remover apenas o runtime do Wine ou tudo o que o Whisky armazenou, incluindo todas as Bottles?\n\nRemover tudo \u00e9 permanente e n\u00e3o pode ser desfeito."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remover apenas o runtime do Wine ou tudo o que o Whisky guardou, incluindo todas as Bottles?\n\nRemover tudo \u00e9 permanente e n\u00e3o pode ser anulado."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimini doar runtime-ul Wine sau tot ce a stocat Whisky, inclusiv toate sticlele?\n\nEliminarea complet\u0103 este definitiv\u0103 \u0219i nu poate fi anulat\u0103."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0443 Wine \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0432\u0441\u0451, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0442 Whisky, \u0432\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0430\u044f \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0442\u044b\u043b\u043a\u0438?\n\n\u041f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043c\u043e."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vill du ta bort enbart Wine-runtime eller allt som Whisky har sparat \u2014 inklusive alla flaskor?\n\nAtt ta bort allt \u00e4r permanent och g\u00e5r inte att \u00e5ngra."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yaln\u0131zca Wine \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma zaman\u0131 m\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131ls\u0131n, yoksa Whisky'nin saklad\u0131\u011f\u0131 her \u015fey \u2014 t\u00fcm \u015fi\u015feler dahil \u2014 kald\u0131r\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131?\n\nHer \u015feyi kald\u0131rmak kal\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r ve geri al\u0131namaz."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0438\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u043b\u0438\u0448\u0435 \u0440\u0443\u0448\u0456\u0439 Wine \u0447\u0438 \u0432\u0441\u0435, \u0449\u043e \u0437\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0456\u0433\u0430\u0454 Whisky, \u0432\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u043d\u043e \u0437 \u0443\u0441\u0456\u043c\u0430 \u043f\u043b\u044f\u0448\u043a\u0430\u043c\u0438?\n\n\u041f\u043e\u0432\u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0437\u0432\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442\u043d\u0435."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ch\u1ec9 g\u1ee1 runtime Wine, hay g\u1ee1 m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 Whisky \u0111\u00e3 l\u01b0u \u2014 k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 bottle?\n\nG\u1ee1 m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 l\u00e0 v\u0129nh vi\u1ec5n v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u00e1c."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ec5\u79fb\u9664 Wine \u8fd0\u884c\u65f6\uff0c\u8fd8\u662f\u79fb\u9664 Whisky \u5b58\u50a8\u7684\u6240\u6709\u5185\u5bb9\uff08\u5305\u62ec\u5168\u90e8 Bottle\uff09\uff1f\n\n\u79fb\u9664\u5168\u90e8\u5185\u5bb9\u662f\u6c38\u4e45\u6027\u7684\uff0c\u4e14\u65e0\u6cd5\u64a4\u9500\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u53ea\u79fb\u9664 Wine \u57f7\u884c\u968e\u6bb5\uff0c\u9084\u662f\u79fb\u9664 Whisky \u5132\u5b58\u7684\u6240\u6709\u5167\u5bb9\uff08\u5305\u62ec\u6240\u6709 Bottle\uff09\uff1f\n\n\u5168\u90e8\u79fb\u9664\u662f\u6c38\u4e45\u6027\u7684\uff0c\u4e14\u7121\u6cd5\u9084\u539f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
