    "setup.whiskywine.error.checksumMismatch": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0644\u0645 \u062a\u062c\u062a\u0632 \u0628\u064a\u0626\u0629 \u062a\u0634\u063a\u064a\u0644 Wine \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u062a\u0645 \u062a\u0646\u0632\u064a\u0644\u0647\u0627 \u0641\u062d\u0635 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645\u0629 \u0648\u0644\u0645 \u064a\u062a\u0645 \u062a\u062b\u0628\u064a\u062a\u0647\u0627. \u064a\u0639\u0646\u064a \u0630\u0644\u0643 \u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629\u064b \u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0646\u0632\u064a\u0644 \u062a\u0627\u0644\u0641. \u064a\u064f\u0631\u062c\u0649 \u0625\u0639\u0627\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u0627\u0648\u0644\u0629."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sta\u017een\u00e9 prost\u0159ed\u00ed Wine nepro\u0161lo kontrolou integrity a nebylo nainstalov\u00e1no. Obvykle to znamen\u00e1 po\u0161kozen\u00e9 sta\u017een\u00ed. Zkuste to pros\u00edm znovu."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den hentede Wine-runtime bestod ikke integritetstjekket og blev ikke installeret. Det betyder som regel, at overf\u00f8rslen blev beskadiget. Pr\u00f8v igen."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die geladene Wine-Runtime hat die Integrit\u00e4tspr\u00fcfung nicht bestanden und wurde nicht installiert. Meist ist der Download besch\u00e4digt. Bitte versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The downloaded Wine runtime failed its integrity check and was not installed. This usually means the download was corrupted. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The downloaded Wine runtime failed its integrity check and was not installed. This usually means the download was corrupted. Please try again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El runtime de Wine descargado no ha superado la comprobaci\u00f3n de integridad y no se ha instalado. Suele deberse a una descarga da\u00f1ada. Int\u00e9ntalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ladattu Wine-ajoymp\u00e4rist\u00f6 ei l\u00e4p\u00e4issyt eheystarkistusta eik\u00e4 sit\u00e4 asennettu. Yleens\u00e4 t\u00e4m\u00e4 tarkoittaa, ett\u00e4 lataus vioittui. Yrit\u00e4 uudelleen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le runtime Wine t\u00e9l\u00e9charg\u00e9 n'a pas pass\u00e9 le contr\u00f4le d'int\u00e9grit\u00e9 et n'a pas \u00e9t\u00e9 install\u00e9. Le t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement est probablement corrompu. Veuillez r\u00e9essayer."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il runtime Wine scaricato non ha superato il controllo di integrit\u00e0 e non \u00e8 stato installato. Di solito significa che il download \u00e8 danneggiato. Riprova."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30c0\u30a6\u30f3\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3057\u305f Wine \u30e9\u30f3\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u304c\u6574\u5408\u6027\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u306b\u901a\u3089\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u305f\u3081\u3001\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3055\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002\u591a\u304f\u306e\u5834\u5408\u3001\u30c0\u30a6\u30f3\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u304c\u7834\u640d\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3082\u3046\u4e00\u5ea6\u304a\u8a66\u3057\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2e4\uc6b4\ub85c\ub4dc\ud55c Wine \ub7f0\ud0c0\uc784\uc774 \ubb34\uacb0\uc131 \uac80\uc0ac\ub97c \ud1b5\uacfc\ud558\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud574 \uc124\uce58\ub418\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc558\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub300\uac1c \ub2e4\uc6b4\ub85c\ub4dc\uac00 \uc190\uc0c1\ub41c \uacbd\uc6b0\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2e4\uc2dc \uc2dc\ub3c4\ud574 \uc8fc\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De gedownloade Wine-runtime is niet door de integriteitscontrole gekomen en is niet ge\u00efnstalleerd. Meestal is de download beschadigd. Probeer het opnieuw."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pobrany silnik Wine nie przeszed\u0142 kontroli integralno\u015bci i nie zosta\u0142 zainstalowany. Zwykle oznacza to uszkodzone pobieranie. Spr\u00f3buj ponownie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O runtime do Wine baixado n\u00e3o passou na verifica\u00e7\u00e3o de integridade e n\u00e3o foi instalado. Em geral, isso significa que o download foi corrompido. Tente novamente."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O runtime do Wine transferido n\u00e3o passou a verifica\u00e7\u00e3o de integridade e n\u00e3o foi instalado. Normalmente, isto significa que a transfer\u00eancia ficou danificada. Tente novamente."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runtime-ul Wine desc\u0103rcat nu a trecut verificarea de integritate \u0219i nu a fost instalat. De obicei, asta \u00eenseamn\u0103 c\u0103 desc\u0103rcarea s-a corupt. \u00cencearc\u0103 din nou."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0430 Wine \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0448\u043b\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043a\u0443 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0431\u044b\u043b\u0430 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0430. \u041e\u0431\u044b\u0447\u043d\u043e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0437\u043a\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0430. \u041f\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u0440\u0430\u0437."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den h\u00e4mtade Wine-runtime klarade inte integritetskontrollen och installerades inte. Det beror oftast p\u00e5 att h\u00e4mtningen skadades. F\u00f6rs\u00f6k igen."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130ndirilen Wine \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma zaman\u0131 b\u00fct\u00fcnl\u00fck denetiminden ge\u00e7emedi ve y\u00fcklenmedi. Bu genellikle indirmenin bozuldu\u011fu anlam\u0131na gelir. L\u00fctfen yeniden deneyin."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0440\u0443\u0448\u0456\u0439 Wine \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0448\u043e\u0432 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0456\u0440\u043a\u0443 \u0446\u0456\u043b\u0456\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0456 \u0439 \u043d\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0432 \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439. \u0417\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0438\u0447\u0430\u0439 \u0446\u0435 \u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0454, \u0449\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0448\u043a\u043e\u0434\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043e. \u0421\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0449\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0437."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runtime Wine t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 kh\u00f4ng v\u01b0\u1ee3t qua ki\u1ec3m tra to\u00e0n v\u1eb9n n\u00ean ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e0i. Th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 do t\u1ec7p t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 b\u1ecb h\u1ecfng. H\u00e3y th\u1eed l\u1ea1i."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0b\u8f7d\u7684 Wine \u8fd0\u884c\u65f6\u672a\u901a\u8fc7\u5b8c\u6574\u6027\u6821\u9a8c\uff0c\u56e0\u6b64\u672a\u5b89\u88c5\u3002\u8fd9\u901a\u5e38\u8868\u793a\u4e0b\u8f7d\u5df2\u635f\u574f\u3002\u8bf7\u91cd\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
