    "Steam and Chromium-based launchers require en_US locale to avoid steamwebhelper crashes": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u064a\u062a\u0637\u0644\u0628 Steam \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0634\u063a\u0651\u0644\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0628\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 Chromium \u0627\u0644\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062d\u0644\u064a\u0629 en_US \u0644\u062a\u0641\u0627\u062f\u064a \u062a\u0639\u0637\u0644 steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam a launchery zalo\u017een\u00e9 na Chromiu vy\u017eaduj\u00ed n\u00e1rodn\u00ed prost\u0159ed\u00ed en_US, jinak steamwebhelper pad\u00e1"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam og Chromium-baserede launchere kr\u00e6ver sprogomr\u00e5det en_US for at undg\u00e5 nedbrud i steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam und Chromium-basierte Launcher ben\u00f6tigen die Sprachregion en_US, um Abst\u00fcrze von steamwebhelper zu vermeiden"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam and Chromium-based launchers require en_US locale to avoid steamwebhelper crashes"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam and Chromium-based launchers require en_US locale to avoid steamwebhelper crashes"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam y los lanzadores basados en Chromium necesitan el idioma en_US para evitar fallos de steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam ja Chromium-pohjaiset k\u00e4ynnistimet vaativat en_US-maa-asetuksen steamwebhelperin kaatumisten v\u00e4ltt\u00e4miseksi"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam et les lanceurs bas\u00e9s sur Chromium n\u00e9cessitent la langue en_US pour \u00e9viter les plantages de steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam e i launcher basati su Chromium richiedono la lingua en_US per evitare arresti di steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam \u3084 Chromium \u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u306e\u30e9\u30f3\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3067\u306f\u3001steamwebhelper \u306e\u30af\u30e9\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u3092\u907f\u3051\u308b\u305f\u3081 en_US \u30ed\u30b1\u30fc\u30eb\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3067\u3059"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam\uacfc Chromium \uae30\ubc18 \ub7f0\ucc98\ub294 steamwebhelper \ud06c\ub798\uc2dc\ub97c \ud53c\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud574 en_US \ub85c\ucf00\uc77c\uc774 \ud544\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam en op Chromium gebaseerde launchers hebben landinstelling en_US nodig om crashes van steamwebhelper te voorkomen"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam i launchery oparte na Chromium wymagaj\u0105 ustawie\u0144 en_US, inaczej steamwebhelper ulega awarii"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Steam e os launchers baseados em Chromium exigem o idioma en_US para evitar falhas do steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Steam e os launchers baseados em Chromium exigem o idioma en_US para evitar falhas do steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam \u0219i launcherele bazate pe Chromium au nevoie de limba en_US pentru a evita crash-urile steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam \u0438 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u044b \u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0435 Chromium \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u044e\u0442 \u043b\u043e\u043a\u0430\u043b\u044c en_US, \u0438\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435 steamwebhelper \u0430\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0438\u0439\u043d\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam och Chromium-baserade launchers kr\u00e4ver spr\u00e5kregionen en_US f\u00f6r att undvika krascher i steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam ve Chromium tabanl\u0131 ba\u015flat\u0131c\u0131lar, steamwebhelper \u00e7\u00f6kmelerini \u00f6nlemek i\u00e7in en_US yerel ayar\u0131n\u0131 gerektirir"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam \u0456 \u043b\u0430\u0443\u043d\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0456 Chromium \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u044e\u0442\u044c \u043b\u043e\u043a\u0430\u043b\u0456 en_US, \u0456\u043d\u0430\u043a\u0448\u0435 steamwebhelper \u0430\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0456\u0439\u043d\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0443\u0454\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam v\u00e0 c\u00e1c tr\u00ecnh kh\u1edfi ch\u1ea1y n\u1ec1n Chromium c\u1ea7n ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef en_US \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh l\u1ed7i steamwebhelper"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam \u53ca\u57fa\u4e8e Chromium \u7684\u542f\u52a8\u5668\u9700\u8981 en_US \u533a\u57df\u8bbe\u7f6e\uff0c\u4ee5\u907f\u514d steamwebhelper \u5d29\u6e83"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam \u8207\u57fa\u65bc Chromium \u7684\u555f\u52d5\u5668\u9700\u8981 en_US \u5730\u5340\u8a2d\u5b9a\uff0c\u4ee5\u907f\u514d steamwebhelper \u7576\u6a5f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
