            "value": "Whisky will change two files in Steam so it can run Windows games through compatibility tools, the way it does on Linux.\n\nSteam will stop updating itself, because the check that would undo the change is the same one that keeps it. To update Steam later, use Put Steam Back, let it update, then turn this on again.\n\nSteam will be quit first. The original files are kept."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
