    "tab.tools": {},
    "Technical details": {
      "comment": "A section that displays technical details of the findings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Test Input: System Settings > Game Controllers": {
      "comment": "A hint for the user to test the input.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Test Wine Audio": {
      "comment": "A button that tests the audio of a bottle.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "The bottle folder was created without error but is not on disk: %@. The drive may have been disconnected, or its filesystem may be inconsistent.": {
      "comment": "The error message when the bottle folder",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "These settings can be changed after all bottle processes exit.": {
      "comment": "A label that explains that the settings can be changed after the bottle has finished.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "These settings modify SDL environment variables to improve controller detection and button mapping. Try different combinations if your controller isn't working correctly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u062a\u0639\u062f\u0651\u0644 \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0639\u062f\u0627\u062f\u0627\u062a \u0645\u062a\u063a\u064a\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0628\u064a\u0626\u0629 SDL \u0644\u062a\u062d\u0633\u064a\u0646 \u0627\u0643\u062a\u0634\u0627\u0641 \u0648\u062d\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0643\u0645 \u0648\u062a\u0639\u064a\u064a\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0632\u0631\u0627\u0631. \u062c\u0631\u0651\u0628 \u0645\u062c\u0645\u0648\u0639\u0627\u062a \u0645\u062e\u062a\u0644\u0641\u0629 \u0625\u0630\u0627 \u0643\u0627\u0646\u062a \u0648\u062d\u062f\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u062d\u0643\u0645 \u0644\u0627 \u062a\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u0628\u0634\u0643\u0644 \u0635\u062d\u064a\u062d."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tato nastaven\u00ed m\u011bn\u00ed prom\u011bnn\u00e9 prost\u0159ed\u00ed SDL a zlep\u0161uj\u00ed rozpozn\u00e1n\u00ed ovlada\u010de i mapov\u00e1n\u00ed tla\u010d\u00edtek. Pokud ovlada\u010d nefunguje spr\u00e1vn\u011b, vyzkou\u0161ejte r\u016fzn\u00e9 kombinace."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disse indstillinger \u00e6ndrer SDL-milj\u00f8variabler for at forbedre registrering af controllere og tildeling af knapper. Pr\u00f8v forskellige kombinationer, hvis din controller ikke virker korrekt."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Einstellungen \u00e4ndern SDL-Umgebungsvariablen, um Controller-Erkennung und Tastenzuordnung zu verbessern. Probiere verschiedene Kombinationen aus, wenn dein Controller nicht richtig funktioniert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos ajustes modifican variables de entorno de SDL para mejorar la detecci\u00f3n de mandos y la asignaci\u00f3n de botones. Prueba distintas combinaciones si tu mando no funciona correctamente."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N\u00e4m\u00e4 asetukset muuttavat SDL:n ymp\u00e4rist\u00f6muuttujia ohjaimen tunnistuksen ja painikem\u00e4\u00e4rityksen parantamiseksi. Kokeile eri yhdistelmi\u00e4, jos ohjaimesi ei toimi oikein."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces r\u00e9glages modifient les variables d'environnement SDL afin d'am\u00e9liorer la d\u00e9tection des manettes et le mappage des boutons. Essayez diff\u00e9rentes combinaisons si votre manette ne fonctionne pas correctement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queste impostazioni modificano le variabili d'ambiente di SDL per migliorare il rilevamento dei controller e la mappatura dei tasti. Prova combinazioni diverse se il controller non funziona correttamente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306f SDL \u306e\u74b0\u5883\u5909\u6570\u3092\u5909\u66f4\u3057\u3001\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u306e\u691c\u51fa\u3084\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u306e\u30de\u30c3\u30d4\u30f3\u30b0\u3092\u6539\u5584\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u304c\u6b63\u3057\u304f\u52d5\u4f5c\u3057\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306f\u3001\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3092\u5909\u3048\u3066\u8a66\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc774 \uc124\uc815\uc740 SDL \ud658\uacbd \ubcc0\uc218\ub97c \ubcc0\uacbd\ud574 \ucee8\ud2b8\ub864\ub7ec \uac10\uc9c0\uc640 \ubc84\ud2bc \ub9e4\ud551\uc744 \uac1c\uc120\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ucee8\ud2b8\ub864\ub7ec\uac00 \uc81c\ub300\ub85c \uc791\ub3d9\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba74 \uc5ec\ub7ec \uc870\ud569\uc744 \uc2dc\ub3c4\ud574 \ubcf4\uc2ed\uc2dc\uc624."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze instellingen wijzigen SDL-omgevingsvariabelen om de detectie van controllers en de knoptoewijzing te verbeteren. Probeer verschillende combinaties als je controller niet goed werkt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te ustawienia zmieniaj\u0105 zmienne \u015brodowiskowe SDL, aby poprawi\u0107 wykrywanie kontrolera i mapowanie przycisk\u00f3w. Je\u015bli kontroler dzia\u0142a nieprawid\u0142owo, wypr\u00f3buj r\u00f3\u017cne kombinacje."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas configura\u00e7\u00f5es alteram vari\u00e1veis de ambiente do SDL para melhorar a detec\u00e7\u00e3o de controles e o mapeamento de bot\u00f5es. Teste combina\u00e7\u00f5es diferentes se o seu controle n\u00e3o estiver funcionando direito."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas defini\u00e7\u00f5es alteram vari\u00e1veis de ambiente do SDL para melhorar a dete\u00e7\u00e3o de comandos e o mapeamento de bot\u00f5es. Experimente combina\u00e7\u00f5es diferentes se o seu comando n\u00e3o funcionar corretamente."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aceste set\u0103ri modific\u0103 variabile de mediu SDL pentru a \u00eembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi detectarea controllerelor \u0219i maparea butoanelor. \u00cencearc\u0103 mai multe combina\u021bii dac\u0103 controllerul t\u0103u nu func\u021bioneaz\u0103 corect."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042d\u0442\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u044e\u0442 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u044b SDL, \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0430\u044f \u0440\u0430\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0435\u0440\u0430 \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043a\u043d\u043e\u043f\u043e\u043a. \u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u043b\u0435\u0440 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0435\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e, \u043f\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De h\u00e4r inst\u00e4llningarna \u00e4ndrar SDL-milj\u00f6variabler f\u00f6r att f\u00f6rb\u00e4ttra identifiering av handkontroller och knappmappning. Prova olika kombinationer om din handkontroll inte fungerar som den ska."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu ayarlar, kumanda alg\u0131lamay\u0131 ve d\u00fc\u011fme e\u015flemeyi iyile\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in SDL ortam de\u011fi\u015fkenlerini de\u011fi\u015ftirir. Kumandan\u0131z do\u011fru \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yorsa farkl\u0131 kombinasyonlar\u0131 deneyin."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0426\u0456 \u043d\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0442\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0437\u043c\u0456\u043d\u044e\u044e\u0442\u044c \u0437\u043c\u0456\u043d\u043d\u0456 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0449\u0430 SDL, \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0443\u044e\u0447\u0438 \u0440\u043e\u0437\u043f\u0456\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0440\u0430 \u0442\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u043a\u043d\u043e\u043f\u043e\u043a. \u042f\u043a\u0449\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0440 \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0446\u044e\u0454 \u043d\u0435\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e, \u0441\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0440\u0456\u0437\u043d\u0456 \u043f\u043e\u0454\u0434\u043d\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C\u00e1c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t n\u00e0y thay \u0111\u1ed5i bi\u1ebfn m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng SDL \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n vi\u1ec7c nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n tay c\u1ea7m v\u00e0 \u00e1nh x\u1ea1 n\u00fat. H\u00e3y th\u1eed c\u00e1c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p kh\u00e1c nhau n\u1ebfu tay c\u1ea7m ch\u01b0a ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u00fang."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e9b\u8bbe\u7f6e\u4f1a\u4fee\u6539 SDL \u73af\u5883\u53d8\u91cf\uff0c\u4ee5\u6539\u5584\u63a7\u5236\u5668\u8bc6\u522b\u548c\u6309\u952e\u6620\u5c04\u3002\u5982\u679c\u63a7\u5236\u5668\u5de5\u4f5c\u4e0d\u6b63\u5e38\uff0c\u53ef\u5c1d\u8bd5\u4e0d\u540c\u7684\u7ec4\u5408\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9019\u4e9b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u6703\u4fee\u6539 SDL \u74b0\u5883\u8b8a\u6578\uff0c\u4ee5\u6539\u5584\u63a7\u5236\u5668\u5075\u6e2c\u8207\u6309\u9375\u5c0d\u61c9\u3002\u5982\u679c\u63a7\u5236\u5668\u904b\u4f5c\u4e0d\u6b63\u5e38\uff0c\u53ef\u5617\u8a66\u4e0d\u540c\u7684\u7d44\u5408\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will clear Wine cached audio device mappings and restart the Wine server.": {
      "comment": "The message displayed when the user taps the Reset Audio State button.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "This will install: %@": {
